{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Sunwell applies its visual pulse aura only for the parent lifetime (#1440)",
  "contract": [
    "Sunwell 560123 describes a thirty-second embodiment that dispels fear, sleep and charm from nearby allies every three seconds. Its tooltip references 560124's period and 853225's radius. The authored Sun Well helper 560124 carries SpellVisual 1555, a three-second periodic trigger of 853225, and EXTRA_INITIAL_PERIOD. The dispel uses native mechanic masks 1, 5 and 10 and party targeting within forty yards. A normally acquired and cast Sunwell must apply that caster-owned helper, preserve its authored pulse cadence without a second parent driver, and remove it on expiry, cancellation and death. Native save and reload must rebuild the helper from the saved parent, including a legacy parent saved without a helper, bound its remaining duration to that parent, and continue one pulse every three seconds. Root and an ungrouped player are negative controls. This checks server aura and dispel behavior; rendered color and sound require client acceptance."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 140000,
  "players": [
    { "id": "cleric", "race": 1, "class": 27, "level": 60 },
    { "id": "ally", "race": 1, "class": 27, "level": 60 },
    { "id": "outsider", "race": 1, "class": 27, "level": 60 }
  ],
  "steps": [
